# The radio's first scan after the page opens answers with what it had,
# which can be nothing, and the list fills on the next scan five seconds
# later. Until a scan has had the chance to find something the page should
# still say it is looking, not that there are no networks.
wait-for Settings
tap Wi-Fi
wait-for Not connected
wait-idle
shot settings-wifi-first-scan
expect-missing No networks found.
